<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Nova mensagem — Sonho de Criança</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f0f4f8; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #38bdf8); padding: 32px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; color: #fff; font-size: 22px; }
    .body { padding: 32px; }
    .message-preview { background: #f0f9ff; border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; margin: 18px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #0c4a6e; line-height: 1.6; font-style: italic; }
    .meta { font-size: 13px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .cta { text-align: center; margin: 28px 0; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #0ea5e9; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 34px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; }
    .footer { background: #f0f9ff; padding: 20px 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888; border-top: 1px solid #bae6fd; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>💬 Nova mensagem</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Olá, <strong>{{recipientName}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>Recebeu uma nova mensagem de <strong>{{senderName}}</strong>.</p>

      <div class="meta">Assunto: <strong>{{subject}}</strong></div>
      <div class="message-preview">
        "{{preview}}"
      </div>

      <div class="cta">
        <a href="{{inboxLink}}" class="btn">Ler mensagem completa</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© {{year}} {{appName}}. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
      <p>Não responda a este email — aceda ao portal para responder.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
